# Webflow + GrahmOS Development Rules

## Project Context
- **Site:** GRAHMOS Directory Platform
- **Site ID:** 687f11a214d051312f70590e
- **API Base:** https://api.webflow.com/v2
- **Token:** Use WEBFLOW_API_TOKEN env var

